{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_09", "source_id": "68ce40d2000000000b03dd3e", "title": "🍠1年1度空瓶分享～都是无限回购的真爱品！", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68ce40d2000000000b03dd3e", "topic_family": "空瓶与产品复盘", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1493, "evidence_unit_count": 45, "original_evidence_unit_count": 45, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 154, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["Hello Hello 今天是一期爱用空评价五线回购分享", "黑头倒出夜空了 这一瓶1000毫升 我差不多是9个月用完的", "收紧的状态 不管是臂口 粉刺 嫩肤 酸毛孔 它都有效果 现在家庭把它就里面的酸", "这种天然治愈的 就是我的第二个空瓶了 净撤水的空瓶加补货", "出差呀 或者是我直播 完了晚上回去 我的大脑很兴奋的话 我都会吃它", "第二天上妆俱伏天 再就是我用它配合做家庭版海宿的时候 可以让我浮出更多的油脂", "我后背那些顽固的色尘 都淡了好多好多 它里面有酸也有A 所以用完皮肤"], "retained_quotes": ["第二天上妆俱伏天 再就是我用它配合做家庭版海宿的时候 可以让我浮出更多的油脂", "我后背那些顽固的色尘 都淡了好多好多 它里面有酸也有A 所以用完皮肤"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68ce40d2000000000b03dd3e/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68ce40d2000000000b03dd3e/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68ce40d2000000000b03dd3e/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68ce40d2000000000b03dd3e/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "67a9fb288ccad475790a4496fd978ee8d7296d18d75eb29aa71bb0dd74850b6c", "card_hash": "fa9bcf9da3e58cc052b818eec72d9159c286b3b1c62bfb2889c9b195caabf10d", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_09", "source_id": "68caa1f3000000000e032b58", "title": "细毛孔✈️快的方法跟练（没耐心狠人版", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68caa1f3000000000e032b58", "topic_family": "毛孔与清洁", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "正常经验内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1373, "evidence_unit_count": 42, "original_evidence_unit_count": 42, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 136, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["現在我就覺得我整個皮膚又細又亮 這是我目前用下來縮毛孔 飛快的方法更煉", "長期用的話 像我現在堅持用一兩年了 就明顯的感受到出了毛孔細膩", "不要來回的滑動 也不要在一個地方平衡太久 全臉差不多十分鐘就OK了", "就好好修護就行了 剛開始我先要把它和皮膚稍微磨合好 那這些是我的搭配", "大家最關心的問題 使用頻率還有注意事項 大家記得截圖保存", "所以我先用一個傳明酸 傳明酸它是幫我退紅體量的 效果非常好", "質地特別清爽 所以我一次就再用它用一支 也不會覺得說很膩"], "retained_quotes": ["所以我先用一個傳明酸 傳明酸它是幫我退紅體量的 效果非常好", "質地特別清爽 所以我一次就再用它用一支 也不會覺得說很膩"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68caa1f3000000000e032b58/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68caa1f3000000000e032b58/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68caa1f3000000000e032b58/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68caa1f3000000000e032b58/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "dc4c9483c7ab5dccced098baa8e7eb758837978a9ae0e344a9b04a54a2e2e804", "card_hash": "d88c85df12e182b64d3bd99761d01050aa25841c215a268aee4965ef626b1008", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_09", "source_id": "68cac007000000000e032efd", "title": "家庭版光子的护肤搭配（答疑解惑版", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68cac007000000000e032efd", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "time_feedback", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1344, "evidence_unit_count": 33, "original_evidence_unit_count": 33, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["这是我这个油皮最爱的一台美容仪，细腻皮肤、提亮肤色、缩小毛孔、淡化痘印它通通可以做到，而且用起来方便快捷，不需要插电不用涂凝胶", "2、家庭版光子+水光组合 这个组合从去年分享到今年，不多说了", "不过，一周一次深层清洁还是要继续做的 做完hfx第二天皮肤没有不舒服可以用仪器，但是用了仪器第二天不能做hfx", "SUPRAGEN 奇迹胶原轻龄 冻干精华液", "YDUINVIE易科美 YDUNVIE", "做下来就是在美容院做光子+水光的效果，第二天皮肤摸起来是那种保水度满满的皮肤状态，如果是想快速改善肤质，第二天就看到明显效果的，用一档+半瓶，第二天上妆就明显感觉妆容更服帖", "❗️所以刚开始用仪器=刚开始耐受新的酸+A❗️那么在耐受期间，就不要用功效型护肤品了（酸 A之类的），用几次之后，知道了皮肤与仪器的磨合情况了："], "retained_quotes": ["做下来就是在美容院做光子+水光的效果，第二天皮肤摸起来是那种保水度满满的皮肤状态，如果是想快速改善肤质，第二天就看到明显效果的，用一档+半瓶，第二天上妆就明显感觉妆容更服帖", "❗️所以刚开始用仪器=刚开始耐受新的酸+A❗️那么在耐受期间，就不要用功效型护肤品了（酸 A之类的），用几次之后，知道了皮肤与仪器的磨合情况了："], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68cac007000000000e032efd/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68cac007000000000e032efd/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68cac007000000000e032efd/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68cac007000000000e032efd/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "2dd12fe4c6968578505cd06dc0c685ebb8faca8ff