{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_09", "source_id": "68c942d90000000007029d50", "title": "12年油痘肌，3套真正有用的护肤搭配。", "content_type": "video", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68c942d90000000007029d50", "topic_family": "其他护肤经验", "mechanism_key": "problem_result", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1665, "evidence_unit_count": 49, "original_evidence_unit_count": 49, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 149, "transcript_available": true, "evidence_basis": "video_transcript_and_frames", "traceable_anchors": ["分享我从12年的油豆鸡到现在真正有效的三套护肤搭配 皮肤红敏修护,快速解决,兜兜闭口,还有油皮K老", "我的皮肤那是一点都没有闹情绪 在我皮肤出问题需要净减护肤的时候", "最多不用超过五分钟 但用色修为我的脸上的保险 减少酸对皮肤的刺激", "前面用了酸 后面又要用A 所以中间我会用一个修护精华 给皮肤震静舒缓", "会更安心 那我也会很努力的 给咱们把价格打下来", "连我的治爱气垫在我的脸上都开始浮粉了 但是用了它每天做护肤的最后一步来修护维稳", "那如果皮肤不稳定 又猛要翻车之后 我就会用包慢 它可以快速拯救脸上"], "retained_quotes": ["连我的治爱气垫在我的脸上都开始浮粉了 但是用了它每天做护肤的最后一步来修护维稳", "那如果皮肤不稳定 又猛要翻车之后 我就会用包慢 它可以快速拯救脸上"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68c942d90000000007029d50/video/transcript.txt", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68c942d90000000007029d50/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68c942d90000000007029d50/video/source.mp4", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68c942d90000000007029d50/video/frames", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "50eae6762940427fe14b8930721a4ba2b3397e39d917084e7d039a1a6c543f53", "card_hash": "9955624d42f05fdd703be537f50f0db8d1d19fe1eaf63b47b3f2c1dffbe58938", "callable": false, "status": "candidate_learned"}
{"schema_version": "2.1", "learning_method_revision": "xiaosenlin_unified_deep_relearn_v3_0", "batch_id": "batch_09", "source_id": "68c43bb8000000001b0365b0", "title": "一篇说清楚油皮如何不长痘", "content_type": "normal", "nas_item_root": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68c43bb8000000001b0365b0", "topic_family": "痘肌与痘印", "mechanism_key": "list_decision", "commercial_axis": "产品/商业决策内容", "evidence_status": "complete", "evidence_source_chars": 1351, "evidence_unit_count": 35, "original_evidence_unit_count": 35, "visual_review_unit_count": 0, "timeline_segment_count": 0, "transcript_available": false, "evidence_basis": "image_ocr_and_publish_text", "traceable_anchors": ["每个油痘肌应该都有很多祛痘产品 疏通的、控油的、下痘的、代谢的", "2️⃣日常：水油平衡才能告别油痘 油痘肌出油多，只是一味的用祛痘精华猛药很容易破坏屏障，导致水油失衡反而加重痘痘", "因为里面有鼠尾草和母菊提取物，能在长痘的时候帮我们舒缓镇定褪红，还能让皮肤稳定在一个不长痘的状态", "BreakotsWhile Helping to Prevent", "60 ml 吸收完，干爽又保湿～", "所以一定要定期做深层清洁，我综合了韩式皮肤管理+海菲秀的原理流程，在家三步就能做：1/导出液软化角质打开毛孔门，2/铲子把浮出的油脂铲掉，3/敷一片面膜利用皮肤水合的原理让毛孔深层的油脂浮出后再次铲掉……", "因为里面有鼠尾草和母菊提取物，能在长痘的时候帮我们舒缓镇定褪红，还能让皮肤稳定在一个不长痘的状态"], "retained_quotes": ["所以一定要定期做深层清洁，我综合了韩式皮肤管理+海菲秀的原理流程，在家三步就能做：1/导出液软化角质打开毛孔门，2/铲子把浮出的油脂铲掉，3/敷一片面膜利用皮肤水合的原理让毛孔深层的油脂浮出后再次铲掉……", "因为里面有鼠尾草和母菊提取物，能在长痘的时候帮我们舒缓镇定褪红，还能让皮肤稳定在一个不长痘的状态"], "source_paths": {"text": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68c43bb8000000001b0365b0/images/ocr.json", "source": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68c43bb8000000001b0365b0/source.json", "media": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68c43bb8000000001b0365b0/source.json", "visual": "/Volumes/AFK/zhishikushuju/xhs/accounts/xhs_5a201295e8ac2b0dbae9063a/xhs_68c43bb8000000001b0365b0/images", "visual_override": "/Users/lao_wu/codexAI/知识库/10_Knowledge/candidates/account_learning_workflows/xiaosenlin-xiaoshijie-v2-full/VISUAL_EVIDENCE_OVERRIDES.json"}, "source_text_hash": "f137d9c353bed31bd640cd4ce3465e571e9fd7747113972522c0486fe309d855", 